  "检测到搜索接口的响应格式与 K 线接口不同，搜索可能不可用；两者需为同一格式。": "The search endpoint's response format differs from the K-line endpoint; search may not work — both must share one format.",
  "搜索接口为通用 JSON，如需使用搜索请在字段映射中配置搜索映射。": "The search endpoint is generic JSON; configure the search mapping under field mapping to use it.",
